  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個為朋友們準備的專案。它的目的是為了方便安裝。這是一個完全全新的整合包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>它主要包含裝飾性模組。搭配\"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span>\"，你能體驗極多樣的生物群系，讓探索荒野不再枯燥乏味。\"Extended Slabs +\"與\"Double Slabs\"則新增了更多種類的半磚。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>模組列表：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>+ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betteranimalsplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Animals</a> Plus 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cybercat5555/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">cybercat5555</a> 製作</p>\n<p>+ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-slabs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Double Slabs</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cjminecraft01/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">CJMinecraft01</a> 製作</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynmapforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">+ DynmapForge</a>&nbsp;由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mikeprimm/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mikeprimm</a> 製作</p>\n<p>+ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-slabs-1-15\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Slabs +</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/realblackout03/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">RealBlackout03</a> 製作</p>\n<p>+&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morpheus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Morpheus</a>&nbsp;由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/quetzi/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quetzi</a> 製作</p>\n<p>+ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aocawol/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">aocawol</a> 製作</p>\n<p>+ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldedit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorlEdit</a> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sk89q/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">sk89q</a> 製作</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
